  "gaps": [
    "The ethanol titre and yield records are extracted candidates with provenance marked unverified; none has been reviewed or verified, and many have null conditions (medium, temperature, oxygen, feed), so they cannot yet be compared like for like.",
    "No fermOS kinetic fit, growth forecast or batch simulation exists for a Saccharomyces cerevisiae ethanol run, so no kinetic parameters or simulated titre are available.",
    "No Proforma selling-price run for an ethanol yeast scenario has been kept; the scenario sc-yeast-1 has not been run and its inputs still need a person's assumptions. The NREL corn stover sources describe a process design, not a yeast strain's performance.",
    "The geneOS host rows for Saccharomyces cerevisiae strains (S288C, CEN.PK113-7D) were listed by the coverage map but not read here, so I cite only the two model ceilings.",
    "I did not read the full text passages of the papers, so the study conditions behind the titre and yield records are not confirmed beyond the records themselves.",
    "Dominion holds no molecule or clearance finding matched to this question, and no runbook was drafted or locked."
  ],
